(c) comply with the Authority’s safety, environmental, and quality management requirements as notified to the Contractor from time to time;

(d) ensure that all personnel engaged in the performance of the Services are appropriately qualified, trained, and supervised;

(e) maintain accurate records of all work performed, including inspection results, materials used, and any defects identified or rectified;

